        "original_id": "9ed305d7-4b31-5478-bc8c-4db692956e42",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Reg Presley, Mike Newell, Charlotte Coleman\n- Works: Love Is All Around, Four Weddings and a Funeral, Love Actually, Oranges Are Not the Only Fruit, Worzel Gummidge, Marmalade Atkins\n- Topics: film, music, acting\n\nFacts:\n- Four Weddings and a Funeral is a 1994 British romantic comedy film directed by Mike Newell.\n- Reg Presley wrote the song \"Love Is All Around.\"\n- Reg Presley’s song \"Love Is All Around\" was featured in the films Four Weddings and a Funeral and Love Actually.\n- Charlotte Ninon Coleman was born on 3 April 1968 and died on 14 November 2001.\n- Charlotte Coleman was an English actress best known for playing Scarlett in the film Four Weddings and a Funeral.\n- Charlotte Coleman was also known for playing Jess in the television drama Oranges Are Not the Only Fruit, Sue in Worzel Gummidge, and the character Marmalade Atkins.",
